{"slug":"/students/subjects/accounting/accounting/","source":"students/subjects/accounting/accounting.html","area":"students","kind":"division","title":"Accounting - JUANOVA CORTEX","description":"","subject":"accounting","body":"!..make a modal appear. it should give proper attribution to Phet simulations..!\n    <!-- Navigation Bar -->\n    <nav class=\"fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 glass-effect border-b border-blue-100 z-50\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 py-3\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                    <a href=\"/students/student-dashboard/\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 transition\">\n                        <span class=\"mi -arrow-left\" data-mi=\"arrow_back\">arrow_back</span>\n                        <span class=\"ml-2\">Back to Dashboard</span>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                    <button class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-blue-600 text-white hover:bg-blue-700 transition\">\n                        <span class=\"mi -graduation-cap mr-2\" data-mi=\"school\">school</span>\n                        Track Progress\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <main class=\"container mx-auto px-4 pt-20 pb-12\">\n        <!-- Header Section -->\n        <header class=\"text-center mb-12\">\n            <div class=\"flex justify-center mb-6\">\n                <img src=\"../../assets/images/logo.png\" alt=\"JUANOVA CORTEX Logo\" class=\"h-24 w-auto drop-shadow-xl animate-pulse\">\n            </div>\n            <h1 class=\"section-title mb-4\">Accounting Course</h1>\n            <p class=\"text-xl text-blue-600 font-medium\">Master fundamental accounting principles and practices</p>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Divisions Grid -->\n        <div class=\"grid-container mb-12\">\n            <!-- Fundamentals & Ethics -->\n            <div class=\"card glow-effect rounded-2xl p-6 cursor-pointer\">\n                <span class=\"mi -book-open text-4xl icon-gradient mb-4\" data-mi=\"auto_stories\">auto_stories</span>\n                <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3\">Fundamentals &amp; Ethics</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4\">Core concepts and professional standards</p>\n                <ul class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 space-y-2 mb-4\">\n                    <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        <span class=\"mi -check text-blue-500\" data-mi=\"check\">check</span>\n                        Nature and Significance\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        <span class=\"mi -check text-blue-500\" data-mi=\"check\">check</span>\n                        Ethics in Accounting\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        <span class=\"mi -check text-blue-500\" data-mi=\"check\">check</span>\n                        IT in Accounting\n                    </li>\n                </ul>\n                <div class=\"mt-auto\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3\">\n                        <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <span class=\"mi -book\" data-mi=\"menu_book\">menu_book</span>\n                            3 Topics\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <span class=\"mi -clock\" data-mi=\"schedule\">schedule</span>\n                            6h\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"progress-bar\">\n                        <div class=\"progress-fill\" style=\"width: 0%\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Core Accounting Principles -->\n            <div class=\"card glow-effect rounded-2xl p-6 cursor-pointer\">\n                <span class=\"mi -balance-scale text-4xl icon-gradient mb-4\" data-mi=\"balance\">balance</span>\n                <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3\">Core Accounting Principles</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4\">Essential double-entry and control systems</p>\n                <ul class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 space-y-2 mb-4\">\n                    <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        <span class=\"mi -check text-blue-500\" data-mi=\"check\">check</span>\n                        Double Entry System\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        <span class=\"mi -check text-blue-500\" data-mi=\"check\">check</span>\n                        Control Accounts\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        <span class=\"mi -check text-blue-500\" data-mi=\"check\">check</span>\n                        Incomplete Records\n                    </li>\n                </ul>\n                <div class=\"mt-auto\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3\">\n                        <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <span class=\"mi -book\" data-mi=\"menu_book\">menu_book</span>\n                            3 Topics\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <span class=\"mi -clock\" data-mi=\"schedule\">schedule</span>\n                            8h\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"progress-bar\">\n                        <div class=\"progress-fill\" style=\"width: 0%\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Financial Operations -->\n            <div class=\"card glow-effect rounded-2xl p-6 cursor-pointer\">\n                <span class=\"mi -cash-register text-4xl icon-gradient mb-4\" data-mi=\"help_outline\">help_outline</span>\n                <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3\">Financial Operations</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4\">Day-to-day financial management</p>\n                <ul class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 space-y-2 mb-4\">\n                    <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        <span class=\"mi -check text-blue-500\" data-mi=\"check\">check</span>\n                        Cashbook Management\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        <span class=\"mi -check text-blue-500\" data-mi=\"check\">check</span>\n                        Bank Reconciliation\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        <span class=\"mi -check text-blue-500\" data-mi=\"check\">check</span>\n                        Stock Valuation\n                    </li>\n                </ul>\n                <div class=\"mt-auto\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3\">\n                        <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <span class=\"mi -book\" data-mi=\"menu_book\">menu_book</span>\n                            3 Topics\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <span class=\"mi -clock\" data-mi=\"schedule\">schedule</span>\n                            6h\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"progress-bar\">\n                        <div class=\"progress-fill\" style=\"width: 0%\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Business Accounting -->\n            <div class=\"card glow-effect rounded-2xl p-6 cursor-pointer\">\n                <span class=\"mi -building text-4xl icon-gradient mb-4\" data-mi=\"business\">business</span>\n                <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3\">Business Accounting</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4\">Complete business financial management</p>\n                <ul class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 space-y-2 mb-4\">\n                    <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        <span class=\"mi -check text-blue-500\" data-mi=\"check\">check</span>\n                        Sole Trader Accounts\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        <span class=\"mi -check text-blue-500\" data-mi=\"check\">check</span>\n                        Manufacturing\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        <span class=\"mi -check text-blue-500\" data-mi=\"check\">check</span>\n                        Departmental\n                    </li>\n                </ul>\n                <div class=\"mt-auto\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3\">\n                        <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <span class=\"mi -book\" data-mi=\"menu_book\">menu_book</span>\n                            3 Topics\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <span class=\"mi -clock\" data-mi=\"schedule\">schedule</span>\n                            8h\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"progress-bar\">\n                        <div class=\"progress-fill\" style=\"width: 0%\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Advanced Business Structures -->\n            <div class=\"card glow-effect rounded-2xl p-6 cursor-pointer\">\n                <span class=\"mi -sitemap text-4xl icon-gradient mb-4\" data-mi=\"account_tree\">account_tree</span>\n                <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3\">Advanced Business Structures</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4\">Complex business organizations</p>\n                <ul class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 space-y-2 mb-4\">\n                    <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        <span class=\"mi -check text-blue-500\" data-mi=\"check\">check</span>\n                        Partnership\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        <span class=\"mi -check text-blue-500\" data-mi=\"check\">check</span>\n                        Company Accounts\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        <span class=\"mi -check text-blue-500\" data-mi=\"check\">check</span>\n                        Branch &amp; Joint Ventures\n                    </li>\n                </ul>\n                <div class=\"mt-auto\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3\">\n                        <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <span class=\"mi -book\" data-mi=\"menu_book\">menu_book</span>\n                            4 Topics\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <span class=\"mi -clock\" data-mi=\"schedule\">schedule</span>\n                            10h\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"progress-bar\">\n                        <div class=\"progress-fill\" style=\"width: 0%\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Specialized Accounting -->\n            <div class=\"card glow-effect rounded-2xl p-6 cursor-pointer\">\n                <span class=\"mi -university text-4xl icon-gradient mb-4\" data-mi=\"account_balance\">account_balance</span>\n                <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3\">Specialized Accounting</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4\">Non-profit and public sector accounting</p>\n                <ul class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 space-y-2 mb-4\">\n                    <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        <span class=\"mi -check text-blue-500\" data-mi=\"check\">check</span>\n                        Non-Profit Organizations\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        <span class=\"mi -check text-blue-500\" data-mi=\"check\">check</span>\n                        Public Sector\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        <span class=\"mi -check text-blue-500\" data-mi=\"check\">check</span>\n                        Special Considerations\n                    </li>\n                </ul>\n                <div class=\"mt-auto\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3\">\n                        <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <span class=\"mi -book\" data-mi=\"menu_book\">menu_book</span>\n                            2 Topics\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <span class=\"mi -clock\" data-mi=\"schedule\">schedule</span>\n                            6h\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"progress-bar\">\n                        <div class=\"progress-fill\" style=\"width: 0%\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Study Resources Card -->\n            <div class=\"card glow-effect rounded-2xl p-6\">\n                <span class=\"mi -lightbulb text-4xl text-yellow-500 mb-4\" data-mi=\"lightbulb\">lightbulb</span>\n                <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3\">Study Resources</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-6\">Tools and resources to enhance your learning</p>\n                <div class=\"space-y-3\">\n                    <button class=\"w-full py-2 px-4 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-500 to-blue-700 text-white \n                                   font-medium text-sm flex items-center justify-center gap-2 hover:from-blue-600 \n                                   hover:to-blue-800 transition-all shadow-lg transform hover:scale-105\">\n                        <span class=\"mi -calculator\" data-mi=\"calculate\">calculate</span>\n                        <span>Financial Calculator</span>\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"w-full py-2 px-4 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-yellow-500 to-yellow-700 text-white \n                                   font-medium text-sm flex items-center justify-center gap-2 hover:from-yellow-600 \n                                   hover:to-yellow-800 transition-all shadow-lg transform hover:scale-105\">\n                        <span class=\"mi -sticky-note\" data-mi=\"sticky_note_2\">sticky_note_2</span>\n                        <span>Smart Notes</span>\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"w-full py-2 px-4 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-green-500 to-green-700 text-white \n                                   font-medium text-sm flex items-center justify-center gap-2 hover:from-green-600 \n                                   hover:to-green-800 transition-all shadow-lg transform hover:scale-105\">\n                        <span class=\"mi -cards-blank\" data-mi=\"help_outline\">help_outline</span>\n                        <span>Flashcards</span>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Tips Section -->\n        <section class=\"card glass-effect rounded-2xl p-8 mx-auto max-w-4xl\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 flex items-center gap-3\">\n                <span class=\"mi -lightbulb text-yellow-500\" data-mi=\"lightbulb\">lightbulb</span>\n                Study Tips\n            </h2>\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n                    <span class=\"mi -check-circle text-green-500 mt-1 text-xl\" data-mi=\"check_circle\">check_circle</span>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-700\">Master fundamentals before advancing to complex topics</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n                    <span class=\"mi -check-circle text-green-500 mt-1 text-xl\" data-mi=\"check_circle\">check_circle</span>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-700\">Practice double entry exercises daily</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n                    <span class=\"mi -check-circle text-green-500 mt-1 text-xl\" data-mi=\"check_circle\">check_circle</span>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-700\">Use the financial calculator for complex calculations</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </main>","bodyClass":"min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-100 via-white to-blue-50","bodyStyle":"","css":["body {\n            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n        }\n\n        .card {\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(8px);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1);\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), \n                       0 2px 4px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06),\n                       0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2) inset;\n            transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);\n        }\n\n        .card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-4px) scale(1.01);\n            box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), \n                       0 10px 10px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04),\n                       0 0 0 1px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2) inset,\n                       0 0 20px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15);\n            border-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3);\n        }\n\n        .glow-effect {\n            position: relative;\n        }\n\n        .glow-effect::after {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            right: 0;\n            bottom: 0;\n            border-radius: inherit;\n            box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15);\n            opacity: 0;\n            transition: opacity 0.3s;\n            z-index: -1;\n        }\n\n        .glow-effect:hover::after {\n            opacity: 1;\n        }\n\n        .section-title {\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1D4ED8, #60A5FA);\n            -webkit-background-clip: text;\n            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\n            font-size: 2.5rem;\n            font-weight: 800;\n            text-align: center;\n            padding: 1rem 0;\n        }\n\n        .icon-gradient {\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1D4ED8, #60A5FA);\n            -webkit-background-clip: text;\n            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\n        }\n\n        .grid-container {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));\n            gap: 1.5rem;\n            padding: 1.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .progress-bar {\n            height: 4px;\n            background: #E5E7EB;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n\n        .progress-fill {\n            height: 100%;\n            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #1D4ED8, #60A5FA);\n            transition: width 0.3s ease;\n        }\n\n        .accent-border {\n            border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2);\n        }\n\n        .glass-effect {\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(8px);\n            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);\n        }"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":[]}